<% content_for :meta_title, "Privacy Policy | Fantasy Forecast" %>

<%= render PageHeadingComponent.new(title: "Privacy Policy",
      subtitle: "Last updated: #{Date.current.strftime('%B %d, %Y')}", back: back_home) %>

<div class="mt-group">
  <%= render ProseComponent.new do %>
    <section>
      <h2>Introduction</h2>
      <p>
        Fantasy Forecast ("we," "our," or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website and use our Fantasy Premier League (FPL) prediction platform.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>

      <h3>Personal Information</h3>
      <p>
        We may collect personal information that you voluntarily provide to us when you:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Register for an account</li>
        <li>Submit player rankings and forecasts</li>
        <li>Contact us with questions or feedback</li>
        <li>Subscribe to our newsletters</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Automatic Information</h3>
      <p>
        We automatically collect certain information when you visit our website, including:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>IP address and location data</li>
        <li>Browser type and version</li>
        <li>Operating system</li>
        <li>Pages visited and time spent on our site</li>
        <li>Referring website addresses</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-section" id="play">
      <h2>Play</h2>
      <p>
        If you play our weekly game, we keep:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Your email address</strong>, used only to send you sign-in links for the game. It is never shown to anyone.</li>
        <li><strong>Your first and last name</strong>, if you give them on your profile. They are for our records and are never shown in full.</li>
        <li><strong>Your username</strong>, which is shown publicly on the game's leaderboards. If you don't choose one, the leaderboards show your first name and the first letter of your surname, or "Anonymous" if you haven't given a name.</li>
        <li><strong>Your picks and results</strong> for each gameweek, including your points and accuracy, which appear on the leaderboards next to your username. We keep them from season to season.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Sign-in emails are sent through our email provider, Mailgun. To change your username or names, use your profile in the game. To have your game account and its history deleted, email us at the address below.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>
        We use the collected information for various purposes, including:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Providing and maintaining our FPL ranking service</li>
        <li>Processing your forecasts and calculating accuracy scores</li>
        <li>Sending you updates about gameweek rankings and platform features</li>
        <li>Responding to your comments and questions</li>
        <li>Analyzing usage patterns to improve our service</li>
        <li>Detecting and preventing fraud or abuse</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Information Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer your personal information to third parties without your consent, except in the following circumstances:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>With service providers who assist us in operating our website</li>
        <li>When required by law or to protect our rights and safety</li>
        <li>In connection with a business transfer or acquisition</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Data Security</h2>
      <p>
        We implement appropriate security measures to protect your personal information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. However, no internet transmission is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on your location, you may have the right to:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access your personal data</li>
        <li>Correct inaccurate information</li>
        <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
        <li>Object to processing of your data</li>
        <li>Data portability</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:
      </p>
      <p>
        Email: <%= link_to "support@fantasyforecast.co.uk", "mailto:support@fantasyforecast.co.uk" %>
      </p>
    </section>
  <% end %>
</div>
